<<<
cento. Pl. -os, see -o(£)s 6. The pronunciation is sč-; the word is Latin, but is often mispronounced chě- as if Italian; the Italian is centone, & the French centon.
===
**cento.** Pl. *-os*, see ^^-O(E)S^^ 6. The pronunciation is sĕ-; the word is Latin, but is often mispronounced chĕ- as if Italian; the Italian is *centone*, & the French *centon*.
